<?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="ViewNLM-v2.3.xsl"?><!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD JATS (Z39.96) Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v1.0 20120330//EN" "JATS-archivearticle1.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" article-type="correction"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">Korean J Radiol</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="publisher-id">KJR</journal-id><journal-title-group><journal-title>Korean Journal of Radiology</journal-title></journal-title-group><issn pub-type="ppub">1229-6929</issn><issn pub-type="epub">2005-8330</issn><publisher><publisher-name>The Korean Radiological Society</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2627230</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.3348/kjr.2008.9.2.190</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Erratum</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Erratum</article-title></title-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><season>Mar-Apr</season><year>2008</year></pub-date><pub-date pub-type="epub"><day>20</day><month>4</month><year>2008</year></pub-date><volume>9</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>190</fpage><lpage>190</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 2008 The Korean Radiological Society</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2008</copyright-year><license license-type="open-access" xlink:href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/3.0"><license-p>This is an Open Access article distributed under the terms of the Creative Commons Attribution Non-Commercial License (<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/3.0">http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/3.0</ext-link>) which permits unrestricted non-commercial use, distribution, and reproduction in any medium, provided the original work is properly cited.</license-p></license></permissions><related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" id="d32e60" vol="9" page="59" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="18253077" ext-link-type="pubmed"><article-title>Evaluation of deep vein thrombosis with multidetector row CT after orthopedic arthroplasty: a prospective study for comparison with Doppler sonography</article-title></related-article></article-meta></front><body><p>The publisher and authors would like to draw the reader's attention to an error in the following article.</p><p>Evaluation of Deep Vein Thrombosis with Multidetector Row CT after Orthopedic Arthroplasty: a Prospective Study for Comparison with Doppler Sonography. <italic>Korean J Radiol</italic>. 2008;9:59-66.</p><p>On page 59, the fourth author's name has been incorrectly spelled as Yong Sun Chun. The correct spelling is as shown below: Yong Sun Jeon</p></body></article>